{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":34,"alongside":35,"kin":36,"engines":61,"usedOn":62,"sites":63,"crewed":64,"museums":65,"hero":66},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/atv.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"specs":28,"tagline":31,"dispatch":32,"description":33},"atv","ATV（自动运载飞船）","cargo-spacecraft","ESA","Multi (Europe)","Astrium / Airbus","2008-03-09","RETIRED","1981-2011","iss-assembly","ESA旗舰国际空间站货运飞船；5次飞行","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Automated Transfer Vehicle — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automated_Transfer_Vehicle","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"ATV — ESA","https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Human_and_Robotic_Exploration/ATV/ATV_history","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"ATV programme retrospective (ESA)","https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Human_and_Robotic_Exploration/ATV","deep",{"length_m":29,"diameter_m":30},10.3,4.5,"ESA的旗舰国际空间站货运飞船；5次飞行","Automated Transfer Vehicle（ATV）是欧洲的国际空间站货运飞船，也是当时最先进的货运航天器——一艘重二十吨的航天器，能够自主导航并与空间站全自动对接，运送货物、水、空气和推进剂，还能用自身发动机为整个国际空间站提升轨道。2008年至2015年间共有五艘飞行，每一艘都以一位欧洲思想家命名，从儒勒·凡尔纳到乔治·勒梅特。ATV不只是一辆补给卡车，更是欧洲赢得国际空间站正式伙伴地位的途径——它验证过的技术延续至今，成为如今为NASA的Orion飞往月球提供动力的欧洲服务舱。","ATV（Automated Transfer Vehicle）是由Astrium / Airbus在欧洲建造的机器人货运航天器。它是ESA的旗舰国际空间站货运飞船，2008年至2015年共执行五次国际空间站飞行任务，运送货物、水、空气和推进剂，同时利用自身发动机为空间站提升轨道。",[],[],[37,41,45,49,53,57],{"id":38,"name":39,"tagline":40},"htv","HTV (Kounotori)","日本的H-II Transfer Vehicle，飞往国际空间站",{"id":42,"name":43,"tagline":44},"cargo-dragon-v1","Cargo Dragon v1","首个与国际空间站对接的商业航天器",{"id":46,"name":47,"tagline":48},"cygnus-standard","Cygnus Standard","仅增压型国际空间站货运飞船",{"id":50,"name":51,"tagline":52},"cygnus-enhanced","Cygnus Enhanced","加长版Cygnus；UltraFlex圆形阵列",{"id":54,"name":55,"tagline":56},"progress-ms","Progress MS","现役Progress型号；国际空间站补给",{"id":58,"name":59,"tagline":60},"tianzhou","天舟","天宫货运飞船",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/atv/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
